---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Product Search Coming Soon | Buy Better Finds" description="Buy Better Finds is preparing an Amazon-connected product search experience with product research, pros and cons, comparisons, and buying guidance.">
  <section class="search-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="search-hero-grid">
        <div class="search-hero-copy">
          <div class="eyebrow">PRODUCT SEARCH · COMING SOON</div>
          <h1>Search a product.<br /><span>Understand it before you buy.</span></h1>
          <p>We're building a product search experience that connects Amazon product listings with Buy Better Finds research, including strengths, tradeoffs, comparisons, and who each product is best for.</p>
          <div class="status-pill"><span></span> Amazon-connected search is being prepared</div>
        </div>

        <div class="search-panel">
          <div class="search-panel-top">
            <div class="placeholder-icon">⌕</div>
            <div>
              <strong>Amazon Product Search</strong>
              <span>Coming soon</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <label for="product-search">Search for a product, brand, or model</label>
          <div class="search-input">
            <input id="product-search" type="search" placeholder="e.g. Sony WH-1000XM5" disabled aria-describedby="search-status" />
            <button type="button" disabled>Search</button>
          </div>
          <p id="search-status">Live search will be enabled once Amazon Creators API access is available for the Buy Better Finds Associates account.</p>
          <div class="search-panel-note">No product search is performed on this page yet. This is the preview of the experience we're building.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section how-search-works">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">THE PLAN</div>
          <h2>From search to a smarter shortlist.</h2>
          <p>The goal is to make search useful—not just another way to send you to a retailer.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="search-flow">
        <article>
          <b>01</b>
          <div class="flow-icon">⌕</div>
          <h3>Search</h3>
          <p>Enter a product name, brand, model, or product type.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <b>02</b>
          <div class="flow-icon">◫</div>
          <h3>Understand</h3>
          <p>See the information that matters, including intended use, strengths, limitations, and tradeoffs.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <b>03</b>
          <div class="flow-icon">⇄</div>
          <h3>Compare</h3>
          <p>Put relevant alternatives side by side when more than one option makes sense.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <b>04</b>
          <div class="flow-icon">✓</div>
          <h3>Shop</h3>
          <p>Check the retailer listing for current price, availability, and final purchase details.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section search-now">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="search-now-card">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">WHILE YOU WAIT</div>
          <h2>Start with products we've already researched.</h2>
          <p>You can browse our current product library now. Every product includes a clear reason to consider it, who it's best for, and what to watch before buying.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="search-now-actions">
          <a class="btn primary" href="/products/">Browse Our Finds →</a>
          <a class="btn secondary" href="/categories/">Browse Categories</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section search-categories">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head centered">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">EXPLORE NOW</div>
          <h2>Shop by category.</h2>
          <p>These categories will also become searchable once live product search is enabled.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="category-links">
        <a href="/categories/tech/">Tech <span>→</span></a>
        <a href="/categories/home-kitchen/">Home &amp; Kitchen <span>→</span></a>
        <a href="/categories/tools-diy/">Tools &amp; DIY <span>→</span></a>
        <a href="/categories/outdoor/">Outdoor <span>→</span></a>
        <a href="/categories/smart-home/">Smart Home <span>→</span></a>
        <a href="/categories/fitness/">Fitness <span>→</span></a>
        <a href="/categories/lifestyle/">Lifestyle <span>→</span></a>
        <a href="/categories/gifts-collectibles/">Gifts &amp; Collectibles <span>→</span></a>
        <a href="/categories/toys-games/">Toys &amp; Games <span>→</span></a>
        <a href="/categories/beauty-personal-care/">Beauty &amp; Personal Care <span>→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section search-footer-note">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="note-card">
        <strong>What will power the live search?</strong>
        <p>The planned experience requires Amazon's Creators API access for the Buy Better Finds Associates account. Until that access is available, this page intentionally keeps the search controls inactive rather than presenting a search that does not actually work.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .search-hero{background:#10233f;color:#fff;padding:74px 0 78px}
  .search-hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:58px;align-items:center}
  .search-hero-copy .eyebrow{color:#d6a84f}
  .search-hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.35rem,5vw,4.25rem);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:12px 0 18px}
  .search-hero h1 span{color:#d6a84f}
  .search-hero-copy>p{max-width:650px;color:#d5deea;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 24px}
  .status-pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;border:1px solid #39506e;background:#172d49;border-radius:999px;padding:9px 13px;color:#dbe5f0;font-size:11px;font-weight:800}
  .status-pill span{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#d6a84f;display:block}
  .search-panel{background:#fff;color:#10233f;border-radius:18px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 25px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.24)}
  .search-panel-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:24px}
  .placeholder-icon{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;background:#eef3f8;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:28px}
  .search-panel-top strong{display:block;font-size:18px}
  .search-panel-top span{display:block;margin-top:4px;font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#c8102e;font-weight:900}
  .search-panel label{display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;color:#405166;margin-bottom:8px}
  .search-input{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:8px}
  .search-input input{min-width:0;border:1px solid #d7e0e9;border-radius:8px;padding:13px 14px;font:inherit;font-size:13px;background:#f8fafc;color:#64748b}
  .search-input button{border:0;border-radius:8px;padding:0 18px;background:#cbd5e1;color:#64748b;font-weight:900;cursor:not-allowed}
  .search-panel>p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.55;color:#64748b;margin:12px 0 0}
  .search-panel-note{margin-top:18px;padding:11px 12px;background:#f5f7fa;border-radius:8px;color:#64748b;font-size:10px;line-height:1.5}
  .how-search-works{background:#f5f7fa}
  .search-flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px}
  .search-flow article{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:22px;min-height:205px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
  .search-flow article>b{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#c8102e}
  .flow-icon{margin:18px 0 12px;width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:10px;background:#eef3f8;color:#10233f;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:21px;font-weight:900}
  .search-flow h3{font-size:19px;color:var(--navy);margin:0 0 7px}
  .search-flow p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--muted);margin:0}
  .search-now{background:#fff}
  .search-now-card{background:#10233f;color:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:32px 36px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px}
  .search-now-card .eyebrow{color:#d6a84f}
  .search-now-card h2{margin:7px 0 9px;font-size:28px}
  .search-now-card p{color:#d5deea;max-width:720px;line-height:1.6;margin:0}
  .search-now-actions{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;flex:0 0 auto}
  .search-now-actions .secondary{border-color:#6b7c91;color:#fff}
  .search-categories{background:#f5f7fa}
  .centered{text-align:center}
  .centered>div{margin:0 auto}
  .category-links{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:12px}
  .category-links a{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:16px;color:var(--navy);font-size:12px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;transition:.2s}
  .category-links a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);border-color:#b8c7d8;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(16,35,63,.08)}
  .category-links span{color:#1f5f9f}
  .search-footer-note{background:#fff;padding-top:10px}
  .note-card{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:22px 0 8px;text-align:center;max-width:900px;margin:0 auto}
  .note-card strong{font-size:12px;color:var(--navy)}
  .note-card p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0 0}
  @media(max-width:1000px){
    .search-hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:36px}
    .search-panel{max-width:650px}
    .search-flow{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
    .category-links{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
    .search-now-card{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}
  }
  @media(max-width:600px){
    .search-hero{padding:52px 0 58px}
    .search-hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,11vw,3.2rem)}
    .search-hero-copy>p{font-size:14px}
    .search-panel{padding:20px;border-radius:14px}
    .search-input{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .search-input button{min-height:42px}
    .search-flow{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .search-flow article{min-height:0}
    .search-now-card{padding:25px 22px}
    .search-now-card h2{font-size:23px}
    .search-now-actions{width:100%;flex-direction:column}
    .search-now-actions a{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;text-align:center}
    .category-links{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  }
</style>
